WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You reach the bottom of a page and realize you missed its meaning. The words were there. Your attention wasn't.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Some wandering is voluntary. Some catches us by surprise. Research warns against treating both as the same thing.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A twelve-minute interval is a manageable experiment with your own routine, not scientific proof that a recording changes your brain.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Notice the detour. Return to the task. Write down what you completed.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
First learn the method for free. Then evaluate any paid program by its actual contents and evidence.
